# AI Rules for Pathly

Pathly is a Progressive Web App (PWA) designed for mountain hiking enthusiasts to aid in obtaining the PTTK Mountain Tourist Badge (GOT) at the Small level (Popular, Bronze, Silver, and Gold). It serves as a digital companion to the official paper logbook, simplifying point calculation and tracking unique routes. A key feature is the ability to import GPX files, which automatically analyzes route data such as date, distance, ascents, descents, and duration. Users can then add mandatory information required by the GOT regulations, like points, and include personal notes. The app also allows for the creation and management of personalized route catalogs, tailored to individual needs (e.g., 'Favorite routes,' 'Trips with children'). Pathly is aimed at both modern, tech-savvy tourists and experienced badge collectors seeking a more convenient way to manage their hiking achievements.

